      "moreInfoUrl": "https://credimi.io/",
      "userJourney": "Credimi makes external interoperability and conformance services easy to integrate into the same wallet-testing workflow, including OpenID Foundation and WE BUILD tests.\n\n1. The developer configures their Wallet component in credimi.io.\n2. They adapt Credimi’s published Maestro mobile-automation scripts to their wallet. Typically, 80–90% of each script can be reused, so the tests remain outside the wallet application rather than requiring test-specific code in it.\n3. The developer launches a pipeline on a Credimi Runner. The runner executes the automation on a physical device, emulator or simulator and extracts the applicable FCAF test results from the pipeline evidence.\n4. After execution, Credimi presents a detailed report showing every FCAF test performed, its result and the supporting execution evidence. The developer can inspect failures, adapt the wallet or script, and rerun the same pipeline.\n5. Pipelines can also run automatically on a schedule or through CI integration, allowing the same reusable tests to validate subsequent wallet releases.",
